  <explanations>
    <question_explanation no="1" id="PRB-4BEF89C988243ACB-Q1">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분의 발음이 다른 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="부정형(옳지 않은 것 고르기)" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>발음</keyword>
        <keyword>다른</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>прось&lt;u&gt;б&lt;/u&gt;а</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · 유성자음의 무성음화
정답은 ④이다. 유성자음 б는 어말이나 무성자음 앞에서 [п]로 무성음화된다. клуб(어말), улыбка(к 앞), общество(щ 앞)에서는 [п]로 발음되지만, просьба의 б는 모음 앞이므로 [б]로 발음된다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>клу&lt;u&gt;б&lt;/u&gt;</choice_text>
          <commentary>어말에서 [п]로 발음된다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>улы&lt;u&gt;б&lt;/u&gt;ка</choice_text>
          <commentary>무성자음 к 앞에서 [п]로 발음된다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>о&lt;u&gt;б&lt;/u&gt;щество</choice_text>
          <commentary>무성자음 щ 앞에서 [п]로 발음된다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>прось&lt;u&gt;б&lt;/u&gt;а</choice_text>
          <commentary>모음 앞에서 [б]로 발음되어 다르므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2019년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="2" id="PRB-4BEF89C988243ACB-Q2">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분에 들어갈 말로 알맞은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>알맞</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>2</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>добры</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · Будьте добры
정답은 ②이다. Будьте добры는 '실례지만, ~해 주세요'라는 정중한 부탁 표현이다. Будьте(복수·존칭 명령형)에 맞추어 형용사 단어미 복수형 добры를 쓴다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>добро</choice_text>
          <commentary>형용사 단어미 중성형이 아니라 부사이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>добры</choice_text>
          <commentary>добры이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>здоров</choice_text>
          <commentary>단수형이며 의미도 맞지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>здоровы</choice_text>
          <commentary>Будьте здоровы는 건강하라는 인사이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="3" id="PRB-4BEF89C988243ACB-Q3">
      <question_stem>밑줄 친 부분에 공통으로 들어갈 말로 알맞은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="어법·규범·어휘형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>밑줄</keyword>
        <keyword>부분</keyword>
        <keyword>공통으</keyword>
        <keyword>알맞</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>Пушкину</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · 여격 요구 구문
정답은 ④이다. памятник кому(누구의 기념비)와 посвящаться кому(누구에게 바쳐지다)는 모두 여격을 요구한다. 따라서 Пушкину가 알맞다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>к Пушкину</choice_text>
          <commentary>전치사 к는 쓰지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Пушкин</choice_text>
          <commentary>주격이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Пушкина</choice_text>
          <commentary>생격이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>Пушкину</choice_text>
          <commentary>여격이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2019년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="4" id="PRB-4BEF89C988243ACB-Q4">
      <question_stem>㉠, ㉡에 들어갈 전치사로 알맞은 것은?</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="빈칸/기호 추론형" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>전치사</keyword>
        <keyword>알맞</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>от из</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · 전치사 от와 из
정답은 ④이다. 사람에게서 받은 것은 от + 생격(от отца), 도시 등 장소에서 온 것은 из + 생격(из Москвы)을 쓴다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>до из</choice_text>
          <commentary>㉠, ㉡이 모두 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>из до</choice_text>
          <commentary>㉠, ㉡이 모두 틀렸다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>из от</choice_text>
          <commentary>㉠, ㉡이 뒤바뀌었다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>от из</choice_text>
          <commentary>от, из이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2019년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="5" id="PRB-4BEF89C988243ACB-Q5">
      <question_stem>Анна всегда рада ____________ со студентами.</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>встрече</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · рад + 여격
정답은 ③이다. рад는 기쁨의 대상을 여격으로 받는다(рад чему). 따라서 встрече가 알맞다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>встречи</choice_text>
          <commentary>생격 또는 복수 주격이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>встреча</choice_text>
          <commentary>주격이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>встрече</choice_text>
          <commentary>여격이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>встречу</choice_text>
          <commentary>대격이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
    </question_explanation>
    <question_explanation no="6" id="PRB-4BEF89C988243ACB-Q6">
      <question_stem>Ты должен много трудиться, ______________ достигнуть своей цели.</question_stem>
      <question_type polarity="긍정형(옳은/적절한 것 고르기)" category="핵심 개념·이론 이해형" />
      <topic_keywords />
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>чтобы</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표 (책형교차대조: 일치)</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 러시아어 · 목적의 접속사 чтобы
정답은 ③이다. '목표에 도달하기 위해 많이 노력해야 한다'는 목적을 나타내므로 чтобы + 부정사가 알맞다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>пока</choice_text>
          <commentary>пока는 '~하는 동안'이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>что</choice_text>
          <commentary>что는 목적을 나타내지 않는다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>чтобы</choice_text>
          <commentary>목적의 чтобы이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>прежде чем</choice_text>
          <commentary>прежде чем은 '~하기 전에'이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="2">유사·중복 출제 2회 (2019년 · 7급 공개경쟁채용시험)</exam_history>
